# Project Coding Standards
- PHP 8.2+ and Laravel 11+.
- Every PHP file MUST start with `declare(strict_types=1);`.
- Follow PSR-12 coding standards strictly.
- Use Eloquent Models with explicit `$fillable` and `casts()` method.
- Use FormRequest classes for any POST/PUT validation.
- Return clean JSON responses with proper HTTP status codes (200, 201, 404, 422).
- Do NOT invent non-existent packages or methods.